<v Ira Glass>《美国生活》由国际公共广播电台（PRI）发行。我们节目的资助来自芝加哥WBEZ电台的听众。

00:58:20.080 --> 00:58:25.180
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who explained my job to me this way back when I was hired--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚负责，当我在那时候受聘时，他这样向我解释我的工作——

00:58:25.180 --> 00:58:34.200
<v Jod Kaftan>Now the job could involve things like building a doghouse for my mastiff, Tim. Or I might walk up to you, and ask  you to take apart a radio and put it back together.
<v Jod Kaftan>现在这份工作可能涉及一些事情，比如为我的獒犬蒂姆建造一个狗屋。或者我可能会走过来，让你拆开一台收音机，再把它组装回去。

00:58:34.200 --> 00:58:42.370
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周回来，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:58:42.370 --> 00:58:56.050
<v Jod Kaftan>Marlon say you work for me now.
<v Jod Kaftan>马龙说你现在为我工作。

00:58:56.050 --> 00:59:01.050
